        "description": "Her Money Blog is a feminine WordPress block theme designed for bloggers, coaches and creators who write about personal finance, side hustles and online business. Built with full site editing (FSE) and the block editor, it offers custom layouts, blog‑style templates, customizable colors and typography. Perfect for a finance blog, money‑making blog, career‑growth blog or entrepreneurial lifestyle site, this clean, responsive theme helps you build authority, attract readers and grow your email list—all without writing any code."
